"The network name. Hidden networks don't broadcast it, and macOS won't reveal it without location permission; both show as “hidden / no permission”." = "网络名称。隐藏网络不广播名称；没有定位权限时 macOS 也不给读取，都会显示为“隐藏/无权限”。";
"The MAC address of one AP radio. One SSID can have many BSSIDs (several APs, or one per 2.4/5/6 GHz radio on the same AP). macOS requires location permission to read it." = "AP 某个射频的 MAC 地址，一个 SSID 可以对应多个 BSSID（多台 AP、或同一台 AP 的 2.4/5/6 GHz 各一个）。macOS 要求定位权限才能读取。";
"Looked up from the first 3 bytes of the BSSID (OUI) in the IEEE registry. “Guessed” means a virtual BSSID (locally administered address) whose vendor was inferred from the restored OUI and may be wrong; phone hotspots usually use random addresses and can't be identified." = "由 BSSID 前 3 字节（OUI）查 IEEE 注册表得到。标“推测”的是虚拟 BSSID（本地管理地址），厂商由还原后的 OUI 推断，可能不准；手机热点通常用随机地址，查不到。";
